Finding: the authentication method is disabled, and no certificate authority is registered
(`certificateAuthorityScopes` empty). Enabling the method alone would not make CBA usable — a
trusted CA still needs to be configured and its root/CRL info uploaded before any user could
authenticate with a certificate.
